Kivaloop brings the world of coffee and community together in one fun, easy-to-use app. Whether you’re a coffee lover or a café owner, Kivaloop is designed to make every cup more enjoyable and rewarding.

🌟 What You Can Do with Kivaloop

Order Coffee Easily
Browse nearby cafés or your favorite shop, place your coffee orders directly from the app, and enjoy a seamless pickup or delivery experience.

Share Coffee Moments
Capture and post your favorite coffee moments, photos, and memories. Connect with other coffee lovers, like and comment on posts, and be part of a growing coffee community.

Play & Win Rewards
Try your luck with our Spin & Win feature! Earn exciting rewards, discounts, or free coffee spins. Every spin brings a chance to win something special.

For Café Owners
Café owners can manage orders, view sales insights, and engage directly with customers — all from the same app. No need for a separate dashboard or platform.

Connect, Earn, and Enjoy
Kivaloop blends the joy of sipping coffee, social connection, and fun rewards into a single, smart platform designed for both users and shop owners.
